[x] migrate to real file storage instead of saving media to postgres @done
    - S3-compatible bucket: MinIO container locally/CI, Railway Bucket in prod
    - clients fetch media directly via short-lived presigned URLs
    - CLIENT TODO (poulse_kora_app): media URLs are now absolute bucket URLs;
      fetch them WITHOUT the bearer token (AuthenticatedByteCache attaches it
      and S3 rejects the request), and GET /users/{id}/profile-picture is gone
